Yahan void ka matlab hai function se koi useful return value expected nahi hai.
5. Optional parameter
Kabhi-kabhi function mein koi argument dena optional hota hai. Parameter ke naam ke baad ? lagate hain.
function greet(name: string, age?: number): void {
    console.log("Hello " + name);

    if (age !== undefined) {
        console.log("Age: " + age);
    }
}

