  TypeScript Lesson 9: Array of Objects 🚀
Ab seekhenge ki ek array ke andar multiple objects kaise store karte hain. Ye real projects mein bahut common hai, jaise employee lists, product lists aur API se aane wala data.
1. Pehle problem samjho
Maan lo tumhe 3 employees ki details store karni hain.
Har employee ke paas name aur age hai.
let employee1 = {
    name: "Rahul",
    age: 25
};

let employee2 = {
    name: "Amit",
    age: 28
};

let employee3 = {
    name: "Priya",
    age: 24
};


Ye kaam karega, lekin employees zyada hue to bahut saare variables banane padenge.
Better solution: Array of Objects
let employees = [
    { name: "Rahul", age: 25 },
    { name: "Amit", age: 28 },
    { name: "Priya", age: 24 }
];

console.log(employees);


Ab saare employees ek hi array mein hain.
2. Kisi specific employee ko access karna
Yaad rakho: array ka index 0 se start hota hai.
let employees = [
    { name: "Rahul", age: 25 },
    { name: "Amit", age: 28 },
    { name: "Priya", age: 24 }
];

console.log(employees[0].name);
console.log(employees[1].age);


Output:
Rahul
28


Samjho employees[0].name ka matlab:
- employees[0] → pehla employee
- .name → us employee ka name
3. TypeScript mein proper type dena
Ab hum TypeScript ka type safety feature use karenge.
let employees: {
    name: string;
    age: number;
}[] = [
    { name: "Rahul", age: 25 },
    { name: "Amit", age: 28 }
];

employees.push({ name: "Priya", age: 24 });

console.log(employees);


Yahan:
- name string hona chahiye.
- age number hona chahiye.
- [ ] ka matlab hai aise objects ki array.
Agar tum ye likhoge:
employees.push({ name: "Sam", age: "thirty" });


TypeScript error dega, kyunki age number hona chahiye, string nahi.
4. Loop ke saath Array of Objects
Maan lo saare employees ke names print karne hain.
let employees: {
    name: string;
    age: number;
}[] = [
    { name: "Rahul", age: 25 },
    { name: "Amit", age: 28 },
    { name: "Priya", age: 24 }
];

for (const employee of employees) {
    console.log(employee.name);
}


Output:
Rahul
Amit
Priya


for...of har baar array ka ek employee object deta hai.

